                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Which level to draw: Lden, or one period (Lday 12 h, Levening 4 h, Lnight 8 h). Lden (L_den) is the day-evening-night level of the EU Environmental Noise Directive 2002/49/EC: the long-term A-weighted level in dB(A) over a whole day, with the 4 h evening counted +5 dB and the 8 h night +10 dB (the day is 12 h), so night and evening noise weigh more than their hours.</item>
