                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Where the levels are asked for: a ground grid inside a disc at pedestrian height (1.5 m; set 4 m to match an END strategic map), and a point in front of every facade at every storey of the buildings wired in. Facade levels are free-field, without the reflection off the facade they stand before, as CNOSSOS and the END define them.

