                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Longest triangle edge kept when Points have to be tessellated — this is what leaves courtyards and building footprints as holes instead of bridging them. Empty = 1.8x the detected sample spacing. Ignored for a regular sample grid.</item>
